# The build context for the agent todo server is this whole directory, because that
# server's image needs both `agents/agent_common` and `processing/database` and a build
# cannot reach outside its context. Unnarrowed that context is the working tree --
# `processing/.venv` and the `.testdata` corpus are gigabytes of it -- so everything is
# excluded and the two directories the Dockerfile copies are added back.
#
# Nothing else builds from here: the worker's context is `processing`, every other MCP
# server's is `agents`, and each of those reads its own ignore file, not this one.
*
!agents
!processing
processing/*
!processing/database
processing/database/db_collection_migrations
processing/database/db_global_migrations
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
